{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And the fowl</b> Three times in the Masorah: והעוף ירב, והעוף אוכל אותם, זאת תורת הבהמה והעוף. A hint to what they said: pure birds are more numerous than impure ones — this is והעוף ירב, meaning they are numerous. And והעוף אוכל אותם — meaning them, the pure ones. And likewise זאת תורת וגו' deals with the pure ones."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:26.568746045Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}